{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are an AI assistant for complex questions. Choose the single best option.\n<question>\nIn a population of giraffes, an environmental change favors taller individuals. More tall giraffes obtain nutrients and survive to pass along their genes. This is an example of:\n<\/question>\n<options>\nA: directional selection\nB: stabilizing selection\nC: sexual selection\nD: disruptive selection\n<\/options>\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"chain_of_thought":{"type":"string"},"correct_answer":{"type":"string","enum":["A","B","C","D"]}},"required":["chain_of_thought","correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}